  "title": "Average age of fathers in the United States: Paternal age trends in the latest data (2026)",
  "summary": "How old are American dads? Men are becoming fathers later in life, a trend that's been building for decades and shows no signs of slowing down. Let’s explore the average age of fathers in 2026, and break that down to explore paternal age in major US cities, compare US paternal age vs. other countries, and understand the potential fertility and pregnancy impacts of older fathers.",
